  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut sweet potato into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place sweet potato on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper.\n• Toss to coat, then roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• Set aside to slightly cool.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58ca93d4e23d8455073fcd/step-1bcd0500.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, grate carrot, squeezing out any excess moisture using a paper towel.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Thinly slice spring onion.\n• Thinly slice cucumber into rounds.\n• Halve snacking tomatoes.\n• Trim pea pods, then thinly slice.\n• TIP: Removing excess liquid from the carrot will help the fritters crisp up in the pan.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58ca93d4e23d8455073fcd/step-59fc4610.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, whisk the egg.\n• Add carrot, spring onion, Southeast Asian spice blend, garlic, ginger paste, the plain flour, salt and a good pinch of pepper. Mix well to combine.\n• TIP: Lift out some of the mixture with a spoon. If it’s too wet and doesn’t hold its shape, add a little more flour.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58ca93d4e23d8455073fcd/step-985fe820.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat the base over medium-high heat.\n• When oil is hot, add heaped tablespoons of fritter mixture in batches, flattening with a spatula. Cook until golden, 3-4 minutes each side (don’t flip too early!).\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate. You should get 3-4 fritters per person.\n• TIP: Add extra oil between batches as needed.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58ca93d4e23d8455073fcd/step-85e0eb30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While fritters are cooking, in a large bowl, combine gourmet leaf mix, cucumber, tomatoes, pea pods and roasted sweet potato.\n• Just before serving, add Japanese-style dressing.\n• Gently toss to coat. Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58ca93d4e23d8455073fcd/step-d0f48740.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Asian-style carrot-ginger fritters and sweet potato salad between plates.\n• Tear over coriander. Drizzle sesame dressing over fritters to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58ca93d4e23d8455073fcd/step-157dcd50.jpg"
    }
  ]
